      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## The multiply\n\nWith nothing on the sweep side, every image runs with every prompt - that is `pair_mode: multiply`, the default (the dropdown stays hidden until you flip the `Show mode options` property): 2 x 4 = **8**. The `save_prefix` output carries each prompt's title through, which is what names the files below."
      ],
